TI  - A microsimulation model for risk in Irish tillage farming
AU  - Loughrey, Jason
AU  - Thorne, Fiona
AU  - Hennessy, Thia
VL  - 9
IS  - 2
PY  - 2016
DA  - 2016/08/31
